msgid "And then a big group of thugs went in right after..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "188"
msgid "I've got a bad feeling about this!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "200"
msgid "Which building? Where!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "212"
msgid "The one on Nakamichi Alley!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "224"
msgid ""
"Damn! Date-san told me to stay out of this, but it's too\r\n"
"dangerous for him to do this by himself."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "236"
msgid "Why, what's going on?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "248"
msgid ""
"There's no time to explain. If you want to find out, you'll have to come "
"along."
msgstr ""

